WEBVTT

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:09.570
Three fell into the trap.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:13.930
Two NUG dogs...

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.410
And one Windermere traitor.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.120
The Aerial Knights!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.100
The enemy...

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.260
How dare you taint the wind, you traitor?!

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:40.800
Hayate!

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.120
Mirage!

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.840
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:02.700
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:18.970
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:22.510
<i>I could place all the blame on you,</i>

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:25.260
<i>swallowing back my tears,</i>

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:30.150
<i>but I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.320
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.610
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.560
<i>(Reach out)</i>

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.790
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:38.280
<i>(To the ends)</i>

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.160
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.900
<i>(Of time)</i>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.700
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.620
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:48.720
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.880
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:01:54.630 --> 00:02:00.220
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.850
<i>I'll leave my body behind</i>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.850
<i>I'll leave my heart beating hard</i>

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:11.280
<i>I'll break free from these chains holding me down</i>

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:17.990
<i>Just come get me, in my purest form</i>

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:30.960
Don't you lay a finger on Freyja!

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.170
This immature failure who 
can't even control her Rune?

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.180
So this is how the valiant Aerial Knights fight?

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:49.140
Is pointing a sword at an unarmed 
girl what you call chivalry?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.350
What was that?

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:53.860
You won't even fight if your Var buddies aren't around.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:56.570
And then you bravely turned tail and fled—

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:57.820
Hayate!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.290
Mirage!

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.830
Hayate!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.930
Don't let your guard down.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:20.260
Damn earthlings.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.030
Can we get through to the Aether?

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.560
Wireless is jammed.

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:34.310
What about the others?

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.140
Still getting vital signals.

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:38.050
Their emergency beacons are activated.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.740
That's not good.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:41.750
The first order is to make it through here.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.590
On my mark, run in that direction.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:45.530
Roger.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:47.490
Now!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.420
Kaname!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.660
Did you get hit?

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.840
I'm fine. It's just a flesh wound.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.380
But...

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.340
We must hurry on.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.540
Roger.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.550
Still no contact with the infiltration team.

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:14.020
And the radar's red with bogies.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:17.730
Just like housewives at an end-of-year sale.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:21.620
Let's see what's in store for us.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.860
What's wrong?

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.870
Get up, earthling.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:37.590
Bogue, do you wish to kill him 
before we interrogate him?

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:41.100
Interrogate? We ought to execute 
him right here and now.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:42.260
Why...

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.320
Why are you doing this?

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:51.850
If you've got a problem with me, 
then take it out on me, not them!

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:55.820
Freyja...

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:59.020
We are at war.

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:01.730
War? But...

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.360
We fight for the great goal of 
establishing the Starwind sector

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.820
and emancipating the planets of the Brisingr cluster.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:15.460
We're liberating the people who have been annexed by the Unified Government.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:20.380
What does that mean? You make no sense.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:25.360
Liberating? You call that liberation?

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:29.640
Mind controlling people? Tearing families apart?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.140
That's not freedom!

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:36.440
It was you earthlings who trampled on our peace with your filthy feet!

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:43.790
Windermere was a peaceful 
place until the earthlings came.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.320
We will take our planet back!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.780
That doesn't... That doesn't mean...

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.700
you should waste food like this!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.160
Huh?

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:01.970
Old Camille and Mr. Niels and the others from the village

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:06.340
worked so hard to grow apples, yet you use them for war?

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:09.720
Is that really what's best for Windermere?!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.810
You should be apologizing to our people!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.270
She got you there, Bogue.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.880
Master Hermann...

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.730
My family had an orchard too.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:30.880
But the farm, the apples, my parents, and my siblings were all lost in the war.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.910
This is war.

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.830
Cassim...

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:44.170
Enough of this farce.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:46.880
Freyja Wion.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:52.350
Why did you abandon your 
fatherland to sing with the tainted?

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:56.540
Abandoned... my fatherland?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.910
Messer! Lieutenant!

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:26.570
You're drenched in sweat.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:27.950
I'm fine.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.840
We must hurry.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:31.510
Let's roll up the curtains...

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.760
Kumo-Kumo!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:38.220
...and start the Walküre show.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.940
Did something happen to Freyja's group?

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.280
I didn't abandon Windermere!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:53.360
Then why do you sing the songs 
of those who you should despise?

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:56.990
<i>Why do you stand on stage?</i>

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.620
<i>For what purpose?</i>

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.120
<i>What feelings do you pour into your singing?</i>

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.090
I... I...

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:11.840
You're merely possessed by this illusion called "songs".

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:19.260
The songs of someone who has no resolve in their heart are not needed on the battlefield.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:24.560
I'll cut down you and your trembling rune and bury you in the soil of our fatherland.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:30.570
That's the least I can do for you as 
someone who was born in the same wind.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.280
Stop it!

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.660
Hayate!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.370
Freyja!

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.800
Lord Roid, why are you stopping him?

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.260
Roid?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.990
I recall giving you the clear order to capture them.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.720
There is plenty we need to find out about Walküre.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.960
We should just kill the traitor!

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:05.730
We are not like the NUG Spacy!

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.400
I know this song.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.160
Took them long enough.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.330
Walküre, huh?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:32.900
<i>I fell in love staring into your eyes</i>

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.920
<i>I became obsessed and chased after you</i>

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:41.850
<i>I can't stop yet, I want to know more</i>

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.650
Stop singing!

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.810
<i>The more I wish, the more I wonder</i>

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.770
<i>The more I feel, the more I burn</i>

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.730
Don't let them trick you! Feel them with your runes!

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:54.440
<i>And I continue deeper into the unknown</i>

00:09:54.440 --> 00:10:00.280
<i>Everyone believes in dreams and love,</i>

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:06.830
<i>But if you don't shoot for the stars, what's the point?</i>

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.200
<i>Love is all or nothing</i>

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.840
<i>It's an unreachable borderline</i>

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:11.840
Freyja!

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>No matter how impossible it may be, it won't stop me</i>

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.960
Are you okay, Mira-Mira?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.720
Can you stand on your own?

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:18.930
Of course.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.890
<i>I'm going crazy</i>

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:26.390
<i>I'm losing my mind beyond my wildest imaginations</i>

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:29.900
<i>I can't control myself anymore</i>

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:34.150
<i>I might be coming</i>

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:36.650
Spread out and capture them!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:40.260
We're detecting a large buildup 
of fold energy within the ruins!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.350
We suspect it's resonating with Walküre's fold waves!

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.200
A hole opened in their air defense?

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:47.930
Looks like our bogies are confused!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:49.620
We're going in, Delta 3!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.190
Yes, sir!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.550
You felt my wind? Are you the Grim Reaper?

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.310
You're the White Knight.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:09.270
I'll finish you in the sky.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.960
Sorry for the wait!

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:21.910
Three of the best Delta Platoon 
Siegfrieds at your doorstep!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.350
Is your arm okay?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.580
In better shape than your face.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:33.000
No big deal.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:38.460
Fuck!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.640
Roid.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:44.350
I know.

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:51.900
His Highness wields his power for the wind of tomorrow.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.950
What's this? Can you hear it?

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:10.910
Is this what Hayate was talking about?

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.620
It's that song.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:14.580
It's the song of the wind.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:19.990
Here they come.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:21.890
It's the same as back then.

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:23.660
It's so sharp it hurts.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.560
And it's much stronger than before.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.100
Are the ruins amplifying it?

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.210
It's the Wind Singer...

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:39.160
But this song has no color.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:45.170
If we can hear the song, does that mean the Var is gonna get us?

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.370
Calm down. Walküre are with us.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.810
We've got the intel we needed.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.330
We should return to Ragna.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:56.760
Jellyfish ramen for everyone once we're back.

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:58.670
I'll even throw in a Ragna shrimp or two.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.660
Roger!

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:01.300
Sounds like a plan!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.760
Come anytime!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:05.970
All units into formation Hellmoth!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.130
<i>Never be satisfied</i>

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:15.810
<i>Human desires are limitless</i>

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.520
<i>Inside is dead and outside</i>

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:22.160
<i>There may be complicated emotions</i>

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.240
Just a little closer...

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:28.450
<i>Pursue everything till the end</i>

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:28.450
Closer... Closer...

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.990
<i>Inside and out</i>

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:38.460
<i>Nothing is stable</i>

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.960
<i>It's all right to take flight</i>

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.960
Foe at your 12!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:45.090
<i>You will long for a sense of place</i>

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.490
<i>Reality and dream</i>

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:51.380
<i>Get into limitless situation</i>

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:49.510
The White Knight?

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.970
Let's duel.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:57.430
<i>Different things fight each other</i>

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:01.060
<i>Reality and dream</i>

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:07.680
<i>It's all over now</i>

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.650
His movements are slow.

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.900
Maybe he's infected?

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.860
<i>Now let's blow this flashing spark and</i>

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:14.210
<i>There's a burning flame</i>

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.950
The wind was disrupted?

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:20.210
<i>Small sparks of fire burn up into flame</i>

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.460
<i>Freedom in galaxy</i>

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:22.880
Wh-What's this?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:26.630
Biting sadness... The song's so heavy.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.630
<i>You will take this to space</i>

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:33.300
<i>At the end I'll jump off to a whole new world</i>

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.340
The fold waves are disturbed.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.600
The ruins are reacting to our song?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.350
What is this feeling...

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:37.740
Missiles!

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:43.900
Oh, shit!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.410
I know that insignia...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.630
Hayate! It's those kids' father!

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:18.750
Dammit...

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:25.730
Hayate!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.980
Freyja!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:29.110
Up!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.540
Cut it out!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.380
Snap out of it, Captain Larrazábal!

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.090
Your kids miss you!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:49.980
Go home to them!

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:52.680
They're waiting for you!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.350
Go home to them!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.190
Hayate!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:08.600
It's useless...

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:16.720
No way I can aim like this.

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:19.160
Don't! You mustn't shoot!

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:22.990
You mustn't shoot!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.080
Freyja?!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.790
The song will reach him!

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:28.820
The song's not an illusion!

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:30.760
Freyja...

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.360
May my wishes reach you.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.200
May my song touch his heart!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:55.860
<i>You couldn't catch up, so you always</i>

00:16:55.860 --> 00:17:04.830
<i>looked up at something from here</i>

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:13.140
<i>Some things vanish if you reach them</i>

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:24.480
<i>You've been hiding your countless tears too</i>

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.030
Freyja!

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:37.340
<i>You've been watching the world</i>

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.950
I can feel it.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.850
Fre-Fre?

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.450
It's tingling.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:40.950
Fold activity rising!

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:44.160
<i>for so long now</i>

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.950
Freyja?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:53.290
<i>You don't have to chase your dreams alone</i>

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.340
This wind...

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.050
Who's that?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:18:01.840
<i>The invisible wind will help you</i>

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:55.420
Who's singing?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:17:59.750
The wind...

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:10.520
<i>I feel I can fly so far, so high</i>

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:05.850
Oh? Fascinating.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:20.610
<i>just please don't let go of my hand</i>

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.950
Leo... Mira...

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.120
Freyja's song worked?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:35.990
<i>Words alone can't convey</i>

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:35.710
Cease this filthy song!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:45.140
<i>the truths I carry in my heart</i>

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.470
I'm not letting you near her!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:52.940
<i>One might know, but not erase them</i>

00:18:52.940 --> 00:19:00.660
<i>You kept hiding your sadness</i>

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:10.030
<i>with smiles, and I didn't notice</i>

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:13.800
<i>It looks like I got too close</i>

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:24.600
<i>to the depth of your heart, and I can't hear your song</i>

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:15.960
So fast!

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.730
Who's this signal?

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:19.670
Hayate?

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:21.560
He's resonating with Freyja?

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:24.600
Good morning, princess.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:33.690
<i>Oh my love, where are you now?</i>

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.400
So persistent...

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:32.770
Take this!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:42.320
<i>The sky is gray and I'm lost without you</i>

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.610
Hayate!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:51.120
<i>There's no wind to carry me far and high</i>

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.700
So long—

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.710
He's riding the wind?

00:19:51.120 --> 00:20:00.720
<i>The sky I can't see is ripping my wings off</i>

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.650
Hayate...

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:15.130
Our fledgling's dancing with the wind.

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:19.320
He'd be proud of you if he saw you now, boy.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:27.740
You'll pay for this, you filthy vermin.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.770
Leader, are Walküre safe?

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.050
Yeah! We're looking forward to that jellyfish ramen!

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.340
Good to hear.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.920
We're moving out!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:50.700
The ruins are returning to life?

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.530
Mikumo.

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.050
What are you doing out here?

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.440
I'm going to sing.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:23.390
I'll make my song reach every corner of the galaxy,

00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:26.860
and put a smile on everybody's face.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.440
Then we won't have to wage war.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.280
So I'm gonna sing!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:38.900
Really?

00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:40.650
Yes.

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.780
Mission 08: Escape Resonance

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:45.620
Are you ready?

00:21:56.540 --> 00:22:03.800
<i>I heard a rumor that the world's gonna end someday</i>

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:09.310
<i>Just kidding, it's obviously a lie</i>

00:22:10.980 --> 00:22:14.650
<i>I remember looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:18.360
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:23.960
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:32.960
<i>You make me truly feel like a girl</i>

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:40.460
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:42.050
You better be ready!

00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:45.640
<i>If my rune shines with a flash</i>

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:49.390
<i>wow woh wow woh</i>

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:52.880
<i>I fall in love</i>

00:22:52.880 --> 00:22:56.350
<i>wow woh wow woh</i>

00:22:56.740 --> 00:23:01.900
<i>Lalali lalala you make me</i>

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:09.690
<i>Lalala rune pika invincible</i>

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.180
ISC cooling complete!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:16.330
Start checking the...

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:20.750
First Lt. Messer?

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:23.340
What are you doing? The captain's calling.

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:25.550
Are you okay?

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.090
Don't worry about me.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:30.300
Lieutenant...

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:33.700
You caught it?

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.730
Next time: Uncontrolled on the Edge

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:39.780
Random fact: Did you know that quite a bit of the translated lyrics in this series is BSed? It's extremely to hard to hear certain lines in the background when there are fucking machine gun sounds blazing in the foreground.
